# Used by BuildKit for docker/Dockerfile.app (context = monorepo root).
# Whitelist: only packages/aec and the shared DXF reader reach the build.
*
!packages/aec/
!packages/cad/sion_cad/
# Never ship secrets, host environments, VCS data or private runtime output.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.bak
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.git
**/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.cache
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
**/node_modules
packages/aec/logs
packages/aec/runtime
packages/aec/projects
